Then one has \[\xb_f-\xb_g=x_{\{1,5\}} x_{\{2,6\}} x_{\{3,4\}}-x_{\{1,3,5\}} x_{\{2,6\}} x_{\{4\}}=x_{\{2,6\}} (x_{\{1,5\}}  x_{\{3,4\}}-x_{\{1,3,5\}} x_{\{4\}}).\]
    Since $x_{\{1,5\}} x_{\{3,4\}}-x_{\{1,3,5\}} x_{\{4\}} \in J_G$, it then follows from Theorem \ref{ExamKempe} that $f \sim_3 g$.
