The module is in place and its full self-test is running. The verifier does more than check the cubic cycle: it symbolically replays the exact singleton-leaf phase and center-component phase, checks the final coloring, and enforces the reduction’s move bound. The expensive part now is the required 200,000 structure-aware guesses plus the 20-seed relabeling audit.
